  era: "1947 \xB7 Section 28 \xB7 Partition and Independence \xB7 1940 \u2013 1947"
  title: Refugee crisis
  text: 'Partition caused one of history''s largest migrations: about fifteen million people crossed the new borders, and communal violence killed hundreds of thousands, perhaps up to a million or more. Refugee relief and resettlement became urgent tasks.'
